            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "CSR"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I grew up on a variation of this - we called it Rum Tum Ditty :) My mother said her mother served it during the Great Depression in the 20s! We substituted grated chedder for the american, added a dash of Worcestshire Sauce and eliminated everthing else but the soup and milk... Still a rainy day comfort food in my family."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
