            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Linda T"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Gosh this was good.. No it is not gourmet faire, but eating it really gave me some childhood like comfort. I really cannot remember ever eating this, but I must have at some point to get that sort of feeling from it. I will make it again. that's for sure",
